# Credentials for the agent harness the dispatcher runs (loaded by telegram-agent.service).
# Mode 600. Never commit the filled-in file, never paste it into a chat with an AI.
#
# Claude Code with a Claude subscription: nothing here, just run `claude` once and /login.
# On a headless server, `claude setup-token` prints a long-lived token for this account:
#CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=
#
# Claude Code with an Anthropic API key (pay per token):
#ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Codex: arrange login for this user, or provide an API key.
#CODEX_API_KEY=
#CODEX_HOME=/home/user/.local/share/telegram-agent/codex-home
#
# OpenCode: sign in to the provider through /connect for this user.
